Subject: [PATCH 081/144] GreatDANE: Explore .doge & .pepe new-tab row (HTTPS
 cache, no Places)

Add a separate Activity Stream section distinct from recent visits. Candidates
come from loopback /gd/names; inclusion requires HTTPS through Dane's normal
proxy + DANE-EE TLSA path. Results live in profile cache (default TTL 6h);
about:newtab paints cache only and never probes on open. Prefs under
greatdane.explore.*; privacy note that refresh probes are not IP-private.
